@startuml flow-user-rental
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: Flow Diagram - How a User Rents a Parking Space

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #E65100
  DiamondBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #9E9E9E
}

|User|
start
:Register as User, verify email;
:Add a vehicle (type, registration number);
:Search by destination, date, time
and vehicle type (map + list);
:Open a parking location, choose the
date, arrival and departure time;

|System|
:Check live availability and return a
**quote**: parking charge + platform fee
+ refundable deposit (valid 5 minutes);

|User|
:Hold this parking;
|System|
:Reserve the space for **5 minutes**
(no other User can take it);
|User|
:Create booking;
|System|
:Booking **PAYMENT_PENDING**;

|User|
:Pay (see payment flow);
|System|
if (Payment validated in time?) then (yes)
  :Booking **CONFIRMED**;
  :Issue a QR access pass
  (valid for this booking only);
else (no)
  :Hold expires, booking **EXPIRED**,
  space released;
  stop
endif

|User|
if (Arrives at the gate?) then (yes)
  :Show the QR pass to the Guard
(up to 1 hour before start);
  |Guard|
  :Scan the QR (or paste its code),
  check vehicle, plate and space;
  :Confirm check-in;
  |System|
  :Booking **CHECKED_IN**;
  |User|
  :Park; when leaving, optionally tap
  "Request checkout" to alert the Guard;
  |Guard|
  :Confirm the vehicle has
  crossed the exit gate;
  |System|
  :Calculate overtime (after grace period);
  if (Overtime more than deposit\nand Refund Balance?) then (yes)
    :Booking **PAYMENT_DUE**;
    |User|
    :Pay the outstanding amount;
    |System|
  else (no)
  endif
  :Booking **COMPLETED**; settle money
  (see money flow);
  |User|
  :Leave a review (optional);
else (no)
  |System|
  :After end time + grace, mark
  **NO_SHOW**; return deposit to the
  User's Refund Balance;
endif
stop

@enduml
